Protocol facts (UUIDs, frame layouts, handshake, effect id ranges) were derived
from the documentation and driver source of LED Union:

  https://github.com/chameleonbr/LED_UNION   (MIT License)
  Copyright (c) 2026 LED Union contributors

No source code from LED Union is copied; frame encoders in this repository are
independent Dart implementations of the documented byte layouts. The MIT notice
above is reproduced out of respect for that licence and in case any future
change adapts code directly (in which case the full MIT text must be included).

Speech recognition (voice Stage 2) uses Vosk by Alpha Cephei:

  https://github.com/alphacep/vosk-api   (Apache License 2.0)
  https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models    (Apache License 2.0)

Vosk is not copied into this repository: Android builds resolve the
com.alphacephei:vosk-android AAR from Maven Central, Windows builds require the
official release DLLs fetched by tools/fetch_vosk_windows.ps1, and language
models are downloaded explicitly by the user. Those artifacts are distributed
under the Apache License 2.0, and their licence files ship with them.
